<title>USA: Cyclone threat to shipping off Vanuatu.</title>
<headline>Cyclone threat to shipping off Vanuatu.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 31P, northeast of Vanuatu, is a threat to shipping in the area, private forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The cyclone was expected to strengthen over the next 48 hours with winds reaching 75-80 mph. During this time the system will move to near 12.4s/175.3e.</p>
